[/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]current_project.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Current-project resolver over the VCS xprompt MRU[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]resolve[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]resolve: add `sase.current_project` with a `CurrentProject` record, an [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]MRU-head-first resolver that maps project refs and Patch names to one [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]enabled project, and a cheap stat-based change token for pollers.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Per-project accent colors[/bold #D7AFFF]                                     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]palette[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]palette: add `sase.ace.tui.project_styles` with a curated accent palette[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and a hash-plus-probe assignment that gives every enabled project a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]distinct, deterministic color.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]ace.current_project configuration[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]config[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]config: add the `ace.current_project` config block (indicator, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]seed_filters, seed_agents_query), its JSON-schema entry, a typed reader [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]on the app, and its configuration docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Top-bar +project indicator[/bold #D7AFFF]                                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]indicator[dim] · [dim][/dim]after resolve, palette, config[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]indicator: add the `CurrentProjectIndicator` widget, mount it in the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]top-bar cluster right of the model indicator, and give it the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]poll/peek/off-thread resolve lifecycle, tooltip, and click action.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Artifacts scope and Stitches startup filter[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]artifacts[dim] · [dim][/dim]after resolve, config[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]artifacts: seed the shared Artifacts project scope from the current [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]project and make it the single owner of the Stitches startup project [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]filter, replacing the synchronous cwd-derived seed.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Statistics, inventory, Glossary, and the + picker[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]panes[dim] · [dim][/dim]after resolve, config[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]panes: seed the Statistics project filter, the Repos/Workspaces [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]inventory filters, the Glossary project ring, and the `+` project-select[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cursor from the current project.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Agents-tab project scoping[/bold #D7AFFF]                                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]agents[dim] · [dim][/dim]after resolve, config[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]agents: seed the Agents-tab search query with the current project behind[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the default-off `seed_agents_query` setting, and attribute a seeded [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]scope visibly in the info panel.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  8 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]sase project current[/bold #D7AFFF]                                          [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after resolve, palette[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: add the `sase project current` subcommand with colored and `--json`[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]output so the resolved current project is inspectable outside the TUI.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  9 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Visual snapshot, help text, and full verification[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]polish[dim] · [dim][/dim]after indicator, artifacts, panes, agents, cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]polish: add the top-bar PNG snapshot, refresh help/command-palette [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]wording for seeded project scopes, finish the ACE docs, and run the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]exhaustive verification lane.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-pw","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-pw.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-6146791e1e472a8da01eb50d411ec333","started_at":"2026-08-18T17:18:02.977578+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"6a46ac80cb185ca1f79c93f9fd3b6aa644afd6d78d8ca13d555093bb5b352812","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-pw.9/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"3fa2839c5e11b5ab4aeed582374d13aebcb73087471d426fdd3800713531578b","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-pw.9/meta.json","size_bytes":632},"prompt":{"digest":"644ec748997155787cc2cd416aee85a3bfbcc26f5817dc7064435c9a756e41f7","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-pw.9/prompt.md","size_bytes":256},"state":{"digest":"99c1e01894808b306dd088d71df08ce38cb35041b7bf1b3d3d6bca0a5772cf9e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-pw.9/sta